<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Exhibition — 左美都の記憶と地脈 | 津田翔一</title>
  <meta name="description" content="文化庁メディア芸術クリエイター育成支援事業採択企画展示「左美都の記憶と地脈」長野展 — 津田翔一" />

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;1,300;1,400;1,500&family=Noto+Serif+JP:wght@200;300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

  <style>
    /* ─── Design Tokens ─────────────────────────────── */
    :root {
      --bg:        #080808;
      --surface:   #0f0f0f;
      --border:    rgba(184,149,90,0.18);
      --gold:      #b8955a;
      --gold-dim:  rgba(184,149,90,0.45);
      --text:      rgba(240,235,225,0.88);
      --text-dim:  rgba(240,235,225,0.48);
      --text-faint:rgba(240,235,225,0.28);
      --serif-en:  'Cormorant Garamond', Georgia, serif;
      --serif-jp:  'Noto Serif JP', serif;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--serif-jp);
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.8;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* ─── Header ─────────────────────────────────────── */
    .site-header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      z-index: 900;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 48px;
      height: 64px;
      background: rgba(8,8,8,0.82);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .site-header__logo {
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-weight: 400;
      font-size: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      color: var(--gold);
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .site-header__nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 36px;
      list-style: none;
    }
    .site-header__nav a {
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }
    .site-header__nav a:hover { color: var(--gold); }

    /* ─── Hero ───────────────────────────────────────── */
    .hero {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100vh;
      min-height: 600px;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
    }
    .hero__bg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-image: url('img/exhibition-nagano/0003.jpg');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center 30%;
      transform: scale(1.04);
      transition: transform 12s ease;
    }
    .hero__bg.loaded { transform: scale(1.0); }
    .hero__veil {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(
        to top,
        rgba(8,8,8,0.96) 0%,
        rgba(8,8,8,0.55) 40%,
        rgba(8,8,8,0.15) 70%,
        rgba(8,8,8,0.05) 100%
      );
    }
    .hero__content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      padding: 0 80px 80px;
      max-width: 900px;
    }

    /* Hero Text Reveal Animation (にじむエフェクト) */
    @keyframes textBlurReveal {
      0% {
        opacity: 0;
        filter: blur(12px);
        transform: translateY(12px) scale(1.02);
      }
      100% {
        opacity: 1;
        filter: blur(0);
        transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
      }
    }

    .hero__eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: textBlurReveal 2s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0.3s forwards;
    }
    .hero__eyebrow::before {
      content: '';
      display: block;
      width: 32px;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--gold-dim);
    }
    .hero__title-jp {
      font-family: var(--serif-jp);
      font-weight: 200;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      line-height: 1.3;
      color: rgba(240,235,225,0.95);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: textBlurReveal 2.4s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0.6s forwards;
    }
    .hero__title-en {
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-weight: 300;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.4rem);
      color: var(--text-dim);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: textBlurReveal 2.4s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 0.9s forwards;
    }
    .hero__meta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 20px 40px;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: textBlurReveal 2s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) 1.2s forwards;
    }
    .hero__meta-item {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    .hero__meta-label {
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold-dim);
    }
    .hero__meta-value {
      font-family: var(--serif-jp);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }

    /* ─── Scroll cue ──────────────────────────────────── */
    .scroll-cue {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 36px;
      right: 56px;
      z-index: 2;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: textBlurReveal 2s ease 1.8s forwards;
    }
    .scroll-cue__label {
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-size: 0.55rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-faint);
      writing-mode: vertical-rl;
    }
    .scroll-cue__line {
      width: 1px;
      height: 48px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--gold-dim), transparent);
      animation: scrollPulse 2.2s ease infinite;
    }
    @keyframes scrollPulse {
      0%,100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scaleY(1); }
      50% { opacity: 0.9; transform: scaleY(1.1); }
    }

    /* ─── Layout ──────────────────────────────────────── */
    .container {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 48px;
    }
    .container--narrow {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 48px;
    }

    /* ─── Overview ────────────────────────────────────── */
    .overview {
      padding: 120px 0 80px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .overview__badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--gold-dim);
      padding: 6px 18px;
      margin-bottom: 52px;
      font-family: var(--serif-jp);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--gold);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .overview__badge svg {
      width: 14px; height: 14px;
      fill: none;
      stroke: var(--gold);
      stroke-width: 1.5;
    }
    .overview__body {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 60px 80px;
    }
    .overview__text-block p {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      line-height: 2;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      margin-bottom: 1.2em;
    }
    .overview__text-block p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .overview__text-block p.lead {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .overview__specs {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0;
      border-left: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-left: 40px;
    }
    .spec-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 16px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184,149,90,0.08);
    }
    .spec-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .spec-label {
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold-dim);
      padding-top: 3px;
    }
    .spec-value {
      font-family: var(--serif-jp);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* ─── Floor section ───────────────────────────────── */
    .floor-section {
      padding: 100px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .floor-section + .floor-section {
      border-top: none;
    }
    .floor-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 64px;
    }
    .floor-number {
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-weight: 300;
      font-size: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
      line-height: 1;
      color: rgba(184,149,90,0.12);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      user-select: none;
      position: relative;
      top: -8px;
    }
    .floor-intro { flex: 1; }
    .floor-label {
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .floor-label::after {
      content: '';
      display: block;
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 48px;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--gold-dim);
    }
    .floor-title {
      font-family: var(--serif-jp);
      font-weight: 200;
      font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 1.9rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: rgba(240,235,225,0.9);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .floor-desc {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      line-height: 1.95;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      max-width: 560px;
    }

    /* ─── Photo grids ─────────────────────────────────── */
    .photo-grid-main {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
      grid-template-rows: auto auto;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .photo-grid-main .photo-main { grid-row: 1 / 3; }
    .photo-grid-sub {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    .photo-frame {
      overflow: hidden;
      cursor: zoom-in;
      background: var(--surface);
      position: relative;
    }
    .photo-frame img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
      transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94),
                  opacity 0.4s ease;
      opacity: 0;
    }
    .photo-frame img.loaded { opacity: 1; }
    .photo-frame:hover img { transform: scale(1.04); }
    .photo-frame::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      border: 1px solid rgba(184,149,90,0);
      transition: border-color 0.3s;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .photo-frame:hover::after { border-color: rgba(184,149,90,0.3); }

    /* Fixed heights for frames */
    .photo-frame--tall { height: 520px; }
    .photo-frame--mid  { height: 255px; }
    .photo-frame--sq   { height: 340px; }
    .photo-frame--sm   { height: 220px; }

    /* ─── Caption row ─────────────────────────────────── */
    .caption-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      padding-top: 24px;
    }
    .caption-row__text {
      font-family: var(--serif-jp);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--text-faint);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }
    .caption-row__count {
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      color: var(--gold-dim);
    }

    /* ─── Pull quote ──────────────────────────────────── */
    .pull-quote {
      padding: 80px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .pull-quote__mark {
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-size: 4rem;
      line-height: 0.6;
      color: var(--gold-dim);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .pull-quote__text {
      font-family: var(--serif-jp);
      font-weight: 200;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
      line-height: 2.2;
      color: rgba(240,235,225,0.75);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
    }
    .pull-quote__source {
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold-dim);
    }

    /* ─── Feature pair / Ceramics ─────────────────────── */
    .feature-pair {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .feature-pair__frame {
      height: 400px;
      overflow: hidden;
      cursor: zoom-in;
      position: relative;
    }
    .feature-pair__frame img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94), opacity 0.4s;
      opacity: 0;
    }
    .feature-pair__frame img.loaded { opacity: 1; }
    .feature-pair__frame:hover img { transform: scale(1.04); }
    .feature-pair__frame::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      border: 1px solid rgba(184,149,90,0);
      transition: border-color 0.3s;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .feature-pair__frame:hover::after { border-color: rgba(184,149,90,0.3); }

    .ceramics-triple {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }
    .ceramics-triple__right {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    /* ─── Back nav ────────────────────────────────────── */
    .back-nav {
      padding: 80px 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .back-nav__link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.3s;
    }
    .back-nav__link svg {
      width: 20px; height: 20px;
      stroke: currentColor;
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 1.2;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }
    .back-nav__link:hover { color: var(--gold); }
    .back-nav__link:hover svg { transform: translateX(-4px); }

    /* ─── Footer ──────────────────────────────────────── */
    .site-footer {
      padding: 48px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .site-footer__logo {
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--gold);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .site-footer__copy {
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--text-faint);
    }

    /* ─── Lightbox ────────────────────────────────────── */
    .lightbox {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 9999;
      background: rgba(4,4,4,0.96);
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .lightbox.active { display: flex; }
    .lightbox__inner {
      position: relative;
      max-width: 92vw;
      max-height: 90vh;
    }
    .lightbox__img {
      max-width: 92vw;
      max-height: 86vh;
      object-fit: contain;
      display: block;
    }
    .lightbox__close {
      position: absolute;
      top: -44px;
      right: 0;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      font-family: var(--serif-en);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .lightbox__close:hover { color: var(--gold); }
    .lightbox__close svg {
      width: 16px; height: 16px;
      stroke: currentColor;
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 1.5;
    }
    .lightbox__nav {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      background: none;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      transition: border-color 0.3s, color 0.3s;
    }
    .lightbox__nav:hover { border-color: var(--gold-dim); color: var(--gold); }
    .lightbox__nav svg {
      width: 20px; height: 20px;
      stroke: currentColor;
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 1.2;
      display: block;
    }
    .lightbox__prev { left: -56px; }
    .lightbox__next { right: -56px; }
    .lightbox__caption {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -36px;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      text-align: center;
      font-family: var(--serif-jp);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--text-faint);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }

    /* ─── Responsive ──────────────────────────────────── */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .site-header { padding: 0 24px; }
      .site-header__nav { display: none; }
      .hero__content { padding: 0 28px 64px; }
      .container, .container--narrow { padding: 0 24px; }
      .overview__body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
      .overview__specs { border-left: none; padding-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 40px; }
      .floor-header { flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
      .floor-number { font-size: 4rem; }
      .photo-grid-main { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .photo-grid-main .photo-main { grid-row: auto; }
      .photo-grid-sub { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .feature-pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .ceramics-triple { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .ceramics-triple__right { flex-direction: row; }
      .photo-frame--tall { height: 280px; }
      .photo-frame--mid { height: 200px; }
      .photo-frame--sq { height: 240px; }
      .photo-frame--sm { height: 200px; }
      .feature-pair__frame { height: 260px; }
      .site-footer { flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; text-align: center; padding: 32px 24px; }
      .lightbox__prev { left: -36px; }
      .lightbox__next { right: -36px; }
    }

    /* ─── Reveal animation ────────────────────────────── */
    [data-reveal] {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(28px);
      transition: opacity 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94),
                  transform 0.9s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94);
    }
    [data-reveal].revealed {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
    [data-reveal-delay="1"] { transition-delay: 0.1s; }
    [data-reveal-delay="2"] { transition-delay: 0.2s; }
    [data-reveal-delay="3"] { transition-delay: 0.35s; }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header class="site-header">
    <a href="index.html" class="site-header__logo">Shoichi Tsuda</a>
    <nav>
      <ul class="site-header__nav">
        <li><a href="works.html">Works</a></li>
        <li><a href="profile.html">Profile</a></li>
        <li><a href="index.html#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero__bg" id="heroBg"></div>
    <div class="hero__veil"></div>

    <div class="hero__content">
      <p class="hero__eyebrow">Exhibition — Nagano</p>
      <h1 class="hero__title-jp">左美都の記憶と地脈<br><span style="font-size:0.65em; opacity:0.7;">津田翔一 個展</span></h1>
      <p class="hero__title-en">Memory and Ley Lines of Samizu — Shoichi Tsuda Solo Exhibition</p>
      <div class="hero__meta">
        <div class="hero__meta-item">
          <span class="hero__meta-label">Venue</span>
          <span class="hero__meta-value">長野県立美術館<br>/ 1F・3F ギャラリー</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__meta-item">
          <span class="hero__meta-label">Support</span>
          <span class="hero__meta-value">文化庁メディア芸術<br>クリエイター育成支援事業</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero__meta-item">
          <span class="hero__meta-label">Year</span>
          <span class="hero__meta-value">2025</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-cue" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="scroll-cue__label">Scroll</span>
      <div class="scroll-cue__line"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="overview">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="overview__badge" data-reveal>
